    "title": "Descobrindo Tipos",
    "descriptionContent": "Aprenda sobre os diferentes tipos de valores que podemos armazenar em variáveis.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17174,
        "title": "Tipos",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145363,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Já vimos e usamos muitos tipos diferentes de valores. No jargão da programação, esses diferentes tipos de valores são chamados de <strong>tipos</strong>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145364,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Strings são caracteres entre aspas <code>\" \"</code>, como o valor <code>\"PlayerOne\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"42\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PlayerOne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"PlayerOne\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145365,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Número</strong> é outro tipo que já usamos. Ele representa valores numéricos como <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O tipo <strong>boolean</strong> contém apenas dois valores: os valores especiais <code>true</code> e <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGameOver = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isGameOver);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145367,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao armazenar <code>false</code> em <code>isPaused</code>, dizemos que <strong>atribuímos</strong> um valor a uma variável.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"49\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>isPaused</code> seguido de <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145368,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como são chamados os valores como booleanos, strings e números?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tipos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Variáveis</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher Tipos.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145369,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como reconhecemos valores do tipo <strong>string</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Pelas aspas <code>\" \"</code> que as cercam </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Pelo fato de que são sempre palavras ou letras</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pelas aspas <code>\" \"</code> que as cercam .</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145370,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual valor é do tipo <strong>number</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"100\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145371,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais são os valores <strong>booleanos</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code> e <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"True\"</code> e <code>\"False\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>true</code> e <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145372,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que é uma atribuição de variável?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Armazenando um valor dentro de uma variável</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dando um nome a uma variável</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Armazenando um valor dentro de uma variável.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atribua uma <strong>string</strong> à variável <code>levelName</code>, um <strong>número</strong> a <code>score</code> e um <strong>boolean</strong> a <code>hasKey</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"67\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName, score, hasKey);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Forest\"</code> seguido de <code>2800</code> e finalmente <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145374,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salve um valor <strong>string</strong> na variável <code>enemyType</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyType = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyType);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Slime\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salve um valor <strong>numérico</strong> na variável.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" livesLeft = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(livesLeft);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>livesLeft</code> seguido de <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145376,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atribua a <code>isPaused</code> o valor <strong>booleano</strong><code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atribua o valor <code>57</code> à variável <code>const</code><code>enemyCount</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;fifty-seven&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyCount = \" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyCount);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>enemyCount</code> e depois <code>=</code>, <code>57</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17176,
        "title": "Trabalhando com tipos",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145379,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>+</code> é o sinal de adição ou junção. Em jogos, frequentemente somamos números (como dano) e também juntamos strings (como texto de UI).</p><p>Ao unir dois valores, podemos obter resultados diferentes dependendo de seus tipos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao juntar números com strings, o número será automaticamente transformado em uma string.</p><p>Una os valores e dê uma olhada na string resultante para uma mensagem de interface de usuário de jogo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;+&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Combine uma string e um número para exibir a pontuação de um jogador.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;99&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>99</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicionar um número a uma string também funciona quando usamos uma variável como <code>score</code> que armazena um número, em vez de um valor numérico.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"result\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Também podemos juntar strings e booleans.</p><p>Combine uma string e um booleano para exibir uma bandeira de estado do jogo. O jogador está vivo?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player alive: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Novamente, adicionar um booleano a uma string também funciona quando usamos uma variável como <code>isPaused</code> que armazena um booleano.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;pass&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + isPaused;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>isPaused</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual sinal usamos para adicionar ou juntar dois valores?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o tipo do resultado de juntar uma string com um número?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">número</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher string.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 damage</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 \"damage\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 damage</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Level 3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelLevel</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Level 3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o resultado de juntar uma string e um boolean?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uma string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um booleano</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Uma string.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss defeated: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Boss defeated: true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Boss defeated: true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione os valores numéricos para obter a pontuação final do jogador.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScore = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(finalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145392,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione um valor de string ao valor numérico e confira o resultado da string para um HUD de jogo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+</code> seguido de <code>\" coins\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145393,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione um valor numérico à string.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+</code> seguido de <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145394,
